    "description": "Phase 291 — body of the salon delete confirmation dialog when this is the owner's ONLY salon. Identical to deleteSalonBody plus a closing sentence that they will be left with none and must create a new one. It must NOT say the owner is signed out — they are not: the flow lands every delete path on «Мої салони» (delete_salon_flow.dart) and the backend never revokes the owner's refresh token (SalonStaffHardDeleteIT: 'the owner's session is never revoked by this cascade')."
