  "@removeMasterDialogBody": {
    "description": "Phase 306 — bulleted consequence body of the remove-master confirmation, most-irreversible first (Phase 291 house shape). Phase 308: backend Phase 299 turned the admin endpoint's DELETE into a hard delete as well, so BOTH staff-removal endpoints now delete the target's user account — the old \"admin verb «вилучити із салону» only unassigns\" contrast this description used to draw is dead; adminSettingsRemoveDialogBody now uses «видалено» too. This body's four bullets stay because each is still true of MASTER removal specifically: booking cancellation/notification (bullet 2) and history-under-a-saved-name (bullet 4) have no admin counterpart and are NOT shared with adminSettingsRemoveDialogBody's three bullets. MUST NOT claim data was erased from our servers: completed bookings survive via a detach-with-name-snapshot, which bullet four states as «під збереженим імʼям», never implying the master's account survives.",
